WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:10,810
It only takes three seconds, how awesome is it?

2
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:18,100
Take a chance, mom hasn't left yet

3
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,660
I won’t leave the baby behind. Let’s go down and have a look.

4
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:20,700
Is mom working out?

5
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:28,780
Why is the baby crying?

6
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,900
Mom makes juice, do you want to drink it?

7
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:36,310
She's worried about you using fire

8
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:37,710
The baby is so good

9
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:40,550
I'm also worried that my mother can't cook or turn on the fire.

10
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:41,550
Just make a juice

11
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,470
Dad makes juice

12
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,150
Okay, you go out

13
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,270
I'll come, you stay with her

14
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:47,510
Mom is always there

15
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:48,910
I will grow up with Rainbow Dash

16
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:50,630
Where should I go next time?

17
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:53,550
Tell your baby in advance that you love your mother

18
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:56,960
Ask for the avocado banana smoothie without sugar

19
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,400
Baby wants candy?

20
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,560
Okay, add sugar
